SkyWater-compatible Python PnR tool
Copyright 2026 MMSalman26 and contributors

This product includes original Python source under the Apache License 2.0.

It is an in-process QoR ranker inspired by open-source EDA algorithms. It does
not vendor OpenROAD, OpenSTA, Magic, KLayout, or Cadence Voltus, and it is not
a signoff replacement for those tools.

Third-party assets fetched or bundled (each keeps its own license):

- SkyWater SKY130 HD standard cells (LEF / liberty JSON)
  https://github.com/google/skywater-pdk-libs-sky130_fd_sc_hd
  License: Apache-2.0

- OpenLane configuration snippets (fetched at runtime)
  https://github.com/The-OpenROAD-Project/OpenLane
  License: Apache-2.0

- open_pdks reference paths (fetched best-effort)
  https://github.com/fossi-foundation/open-pdks
  License: Apache-2.0

- 32-bit ALU gate-level netlist
  https://github.com/HafizMutahirAhmed/ASIC-ALU-OpenLane
  See that repository for the netlist license.

- PicoRV32a gate-level netlist (OpenLane-synthesized PicoRV32)
  RTL: https://github.com/YosysHQ/picorv32 (ISC)
  Workshop netlist: https://github.com/ABHIMR1502/Digital-SoC-Design
